1.d4 { WELCOME TO THE COLLE SYSTEM.

WHY THIS OPENING IS PERFECT FOR YOU RIGHT NOW:
You play almost the same seven moves in every single game. You do not need to memorise twenty different openings. You do not need to know what your opponent plays. You set up your pieces the same way, and then you attack.

Most players your level lose games in the opening because they do not know what to do. After this course, you will always know what to do.

THE SEVEN MOVES YOU MUST KNOW BY HEART:
d4, Nf3, e3, Bd3, Nbd2, O-O, and c3 (only when needed).
That is it. Learn these and you have an opening for life.

WHAT YOU WILL LEARN IN THIS COURSE:
- Lesson 1: The setup and the plan
- Lesson 2: The e4 break (this is how you win)
- Lesson 3: The bishop sacrifice on h7 (the knockout punch)
- Lesson 4-6: What to do when Black plays something else
- Lesson 7: The three mistakes that cost you the game

TIME NEEDED: about two hours. Then start playing it immediately. } 1...c6 2.c4 ( 2.e4 { take the whole center if given to you } ) 2...d5 3.Nc3 Nf6 4.Nf3 e6 5.e3 Nbd7 6.Bd3 ( 6.Qc2 Bd6 7.a3 ( 7.Bd2 O-O 8.O-O-O c5 9.cxd5 exd5 10.Kb1 c4 11.Be2 Bb4 12.g4 Bxc3 13.Bxc3 b5 ) ( 7.b3 O-O 8.Bd3 ( 8.Bb2 e5 9.cxd5 cxd5 10.Nb5 Bb4+ 11.Bc3 Bxc3+ 12.Nxc3 e4 13.Nd2 Nb8 14.Be2 Nc6 15.O-O Nb4 16.Qb2 Bg4 17.Bxg4 Nd3 18.Qc2 Nxg4 ) 8...e5 9.cxd5 cxd5 10.dxe5 Nxe5 11.Nxe5 Bxe5 12.Bb2 d4 13.exd4 Bxd4 14.O-O Bg4 15.h3 Bh5 16.Rfe1 Rc8 17.Bc4 Bg6 18.Qd2 Bc5 ) ( 7.Bd3 dxc4 8.Bxc4 b5 9.Bd3 O-O 10.O-O Bb7 11.e4 ( 11.a3 Re8 12.h3 e5 13.Bd2 exd4 14.exd4 h6 15.Rfe1 Qc7 ) 11...e5 12.dxe5 Nxe5 13.Nxe5 Bxe5 14.Bg5 h6 15.Bh4 Qb6 16.Kh1 Nh5 17.Bg3 Nxg3+ 18.hxg3 Rad8 19.f4 Bxc3 20.Qxc3 c5 ) ( 7.Be2 O-O 8.O-O dxc4 9.Bxc4 b5 10.Bd3 ) 7...O-O 8.b4 Re8 9.cxd5 ( 9.Bb2 Qe7 10.h3 h6 11.Nd2 Bc7 ) 9...exd5 10.Bd3 Qe7 11.O-O Nf8 12.Ne2 Bg4 13.Ng3 h5 14.h3 Bxf3 15.gxf3 g6 16.Ne2 Ne6 ) ( 6.cxd5 exd5 7.Bd3 Bd6 8.O-O O-O 9.b3 Re8 10.Qc2 Nf8 11.Bb2 Bg4 12.Nd2 Bh5 13.Rfe1 Bg6 14.Nf1 Ne6 15.Rad1 Bc7 16.Bxg6 hxg6 17.Ng3 Qd6 ) 6...dxc4 7.Bxc4 b5 8.Bb3 ( 8.Be2 Bb7 9.e4 b4 10.e5 bxc3 11.exf6 Nxf6 12.bxc3 Bd6 13.O-O O-O 14.Bg5 c5 15.Rb1 Qc7 16.Bxf6 gxf6 ) ( 8.Bd3 Bb7 9.a3 ( 9.O-O Be7 10.e4 b4 11.e5 bxc3 12.exf6 Bxf6 13.bxc3 c5 ) ( 9.e4 b4 10.Na4 c5 11.e5 Nd5 12.O-O cxd4 13.Nxd4 ( 13.Re1 g6 14.Bg5 Qa5 15.Nxd4 a6 16.Be4 Bg7 17.a3 O-O 18.Nf3 bxa3 19.Rxa3 Qc7 20.Nc3 Nxe5 21.Bxd5 Bxd5 22.Nxd5 exd5 23.Qxd5 Nxf3+ 24.Qxf3 Bxb2 25.Bh6 Bg7 ) 13...Nxe5 14.Bb5+ Nd7 15.Re1 Rc8 16.Qh5 g6 17.Qe5 ( 17.Qg4 Be7 18.Bh6 a6 19.Bd3 N7f6 20.Qe2 Qa5 21.b3 g5 22.Bxg5 Rg8 23.Bxf6 ( 23.h4 Rxg5 24.hxg5 Nf4 25.Qe3 ( 25.Qe5 Qxe5 26.Rxe5 Nxd3 27.Re3 Nxf2 28.Kxf2 ( 28.gxf6 Bxf6 29.Kxf2 Bxd4 ) 28...Ng4+ ) 25...Qxg5 26.Qg3 Qxg3 27.fxg3 Nxd3 ) 23...Nf4 24.Qe5 Rxg2+ 25.Kf1 Rxf2+ 26.Kxf2 Nxd3+ ) ( 17.Qh3 a6 18.Bd3 ( 18.Bg5 Be7 19.Bxe7 Nxe7 20.Bd3 ( 20.Nxe6 fxe6 21.Bxd7+ Qxd7 22.Nb6 Qd6 23.Nxc8 Bxc8 24.Rad1 Qf4 25.a3 O-O 26.Qg3 Nd5 27.Qxf4 Rxf4 28.f3 Bd7 29.Re4 